1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,230
A toxic gas is being made in your bathroom.

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:03,900
No.

3
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,800
Not that one.

4
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:05,863
Saturday morning.

5
00:00:05,883 --> 00:00:09,107
The American mom declares war on the bathroom.

6
00:00:09,127 --> 00:00:11,252
Her doctrine: one cleaner, clean.

7
00:00:11,272 --> 00:00:12,607
Two cleaners, cleaner.

8
00:00:12,627 --> 00:00:13,216
Three?

9
00:00:13,236 --> 00:00:14,904
The toilet ascends.

10
00:00:14,927 --> 00:00:19,925
But bleach plus toilet bowl cleaner, or vinegar, or some glass cleaners...

11
00:00:19,945 --> 00:00:21,848
makes toxic gas.

12
00:00:21,868 --> 00:00:22,458
Coughing.

13
00:00:22,478 --> 00:00:23,338
Burning eyes.

14
00:00:23,358 --> 00:00:24,426
Chest pain.

15
00:00:24,446 --> 00:00:25,380
And Mom?

16
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:26,260
Proud.

17
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:28,270
She thinks that's the smell of clean.

18
00:00:28,613 --> 00:00:29,673
That's not clean.

19
00:00:29,693 --> 00:00:30,863
That's an ALARM!

20
00:00:30,883 --> 00:00:34,082
The rule: never mix bleach with any other cleaner.

21
00:00:34,102 --> 00:00:34,777
Ever.

22
00:00:34,797 --> 00:00:36,072
Rinse well between products.

23
00:00:36,092 --> 00:00:36,989
Open a window.

24
00:00:37,009 --> 00:00:39,160
If it happens: get to fresh air, fast.

25
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:39,960
Trouble breathing?

26
00:00:39,980 --> 00:00:40,846
Call 911.

27
00:00:40,866 --> 00:00:42,010
Tell them what you mixed.

28
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:42,992
The toilet?

29
00:00:43,012 --> 00:00:44,279
Sparkles anyway.

30
00:00:44,299 --> 00:00:46,845
She'll gaze at it like it just made honor roll.

31
00:00:47,749 --> 00:00:49,220
The gas you're thinking of?

32
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,665
That's another report.

33
00:00:50,685 --> 00:00:53,795
How many cleaners are in your bathroom right now?

34
00:00:53,815 --> 00:00:54,905
Drop the number.
